cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "PCRtools: browser-based design of DNA assembly junctions (polymerase cycling assembly and multi-fragment cloning modules)"
version: v1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-28
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/rkalendar/PCRtools"
url: "https://primerdigital.com/tools/pca.html"
abstract: >-
  Client-side JavaScript modules for designing the junctions of DNA
  assemblies in an unmodified web browser: a polymerase cycling assembly
  (PCA) gene-synthesis module and a multi-fragment (Gibson-type) assembly
  module. Both select junction overlaps for an even melting temperature
  with the overlap length as the free variable. No installation,
  registration, or transmission of the submitted construct.
keywords:
  - DNA assembly
  - gene synthesis
  - polymerase cycling assembly
  - Gibson assembly
  - oligonucleotide design
  - primer design
  - client-side web application
  - melting temperature
authors:
